        "TileImage": "$($repository e82d4acb-9ca6-45ba-b8ca-72b8c9fc75a4).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\rYour targets are five individuals, known as The Original Five&apos;. Together, they control a doomsday-organisation, known as the &apos;Ark Society&apos;. This evening, there is a meeting where, for the first time in many years, all the top contollers come together, to discuss future decision-making regarding that particular organisation, which has close ties to &apos;Providence, making them targets.\rEliminate all targets, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
